  "cil_liability": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, in the absence of a Legal Agreement to restrict parking permits to future occupiers would fail to adequately mitigate the impact on parking capacity arising from the development on the immediate and wider area, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy T6 of The London Plan (2021) and Policies M1 and M2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021 – 2041).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its housing mix comprising one studio flat, 1 x one-bedroom flat and 1 x two-bedroom flat, would fail to provide a housing mix that adequately responds to identified local housing needs, particularly in respect of family-sized accommodation. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy H10 the London Plan (2021) and Policy HO1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) which seek to secure an appropriate and balanced mix of dwelling sizes across the borough.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Proposed Flat 3, indicated on the second and third floors of the development by reason of its designation as a 2-bedroom, 3-person dwelling, would fail to provide the minimum four bed spaces required for a 2-bedroom unit under Policy HO1(2) of the Local Plan. The proposal would therefore fail to provide suitably sized and flexible residential accommodation capable of meeting the changing needs of occupants and would undermine the objectives of preventing overcrowding and securing high-quality housing. The development is therefore contrary to Policy HO1(2) of the Local Plan (2021 - 2041) and is unacceptable in principle.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
